  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help handicaped tortoises in a Rescue Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annually Tortoise Centre receives about 2000 distress calls and over 300 sick and injured tortoises are treated and released back in nature. Most of them are weak, sick r severely injured - with unclosed wounds, infections, fractures, missing parts of the body. They need time for recovery and remain under observation, treatment, and care in winter and do not hibernate. Good basic conditions are required for their treatment, especially heating. We need your help to build a recovery room.</narrative>
  </description>
